## About the standard

Part 4-2 specifies technical component requirements linked to the seven foundational requirements of IEC 62443-1-1 and defines capability security levels SL-C for components.

Official source: [IEC 62443-4-2:2019](https://webstore.iec.ch/en/publication/34421).
